# Graphify exclusions. Same syntax as .gitignore; merged with .gitignore and
# evaluated last, so rules here win on conflict.
#
# Do NOT add "!" negation rules: a single negation disables all directory
# pruning (upstream issue #1274).

# Git LFS embedding model: 2.2 GB locally, including a 17 MB tokenizer.json that
# would be parsed as code. .gitignore deliberately re-includes this path via
# "!retrieval/artifacts/" so CI can bake the model into the image, so it has to
# be excluded here instead.
retrieval/artifacts/

# Graphify's own output
graphify-out/
